# Production cutover governance

Read first: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-29-governance-topology-audit-design.md` and `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-28-production-cutover-mvp.md` (+ errata sibling).

Do not infer Git remotes, cabinet paths, or Alembic strategy from Architecture A without the errata file.

---

