| # | Identity | Verified path / remote |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Production reference | `/opt/remnabot` · `origin` = `k4lantar4/remnabot` · 3.60.0 · READ-ONLY |
| 2 | Maintained bot | `/opt/remnabot1` · `origin` = `k4lantar4/remnabot1` · 4.2.0 |
| 3 | Upstream bot | `BEDOLAGA-DEV/remnawave-bedolaga-telegram-bot` |
| 4 | Upstream working tree | `/opt/bot` · READ-ONLY · never compose-up |
| 5 | RC runtime | `bot-v4` / `91.107.144.95` |
| 6 | Production runtime | `Bot` / `91.107.249.43` · live app at `/opt/bot-remnawave` |

**Cabinet:** `/opt/cabinet` · `k4lantar4/cabinet` — independent; never merge into remnabot1.

**Forbidden names:** `cabinet1`, `/opt/cabinet1`, setting remnabot1 `origin` to `k4lantar4/remnabot`.

