## 2. Tree classes

| Class | Trees | Allowed |
|---|---|---|
| APPLICATION | `/opt/remnabot1`, `/opt/cabinet` | Implement, test, commit on `prod-cutover` |
| INFRASTRUCTURE | `/opt/caddy`, `/opt/remnawave` | Orchestration; no business logic |
| PRODUCTION REFERENCE | `/opt/remnabot`; `/opt/bot-remnawave` on Bot | Read-only inspect |
| UPSTREAM REFERENCE | `/opt/bot` | Never compose-up, restore, or implement |

Production inspection: `ssh bot` (read-only during RC). Production modification only in explicit M8 cutover with user authorization.

